#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:92 48682ceaa1034a2a866c62f9ce90d89b
#: 6a94eb28959e4f08a28f21ce52c808e4 9bb618fe3dd149cab7236f6bebeea96d
#: e4b8e3d1f4d8457b9f15bd291af55c31 f497e29c49a04d3b8af00a0cdc0684b7
msgid "RC aux options"
msgstr "RC 辅助选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:94 0f92c1af61a84c39a640e082991d2861
#: 14937c8a3ee34affa0eb4e9424b31aa4 30ff92236de24c3bad85689cb6fe7999
#: 3cf0c7de84864f7e85855f69ddabda75 806e6ab38edb48fea4f619a2a013f6db
msgid "failsafe actions"
msgstr "失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:98 13ddb58da8344dfa88309ebb2a689933
#: 3eb3431d64f14bc091333e3cc2f2b1d4 900b8e5396994c95833c84e180c51bf6
#: d617ee7796c04918b2738e2341c38f7c dba436a30160488a806e0ba60a81de1f
msgid ""
"This feature may have limitations on certain parameters with exceptionally "
"wide value ranges and when handling bitmap-type parameters."
msgstr "此功能对某些具有极宽数值范围的参数以及处理位图类型参数时可能有限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:103 0a9cc51087b948a5916df3c9cb993492
#: 109035abb1554dd3a0644a96bd23cfed 1155e58f616e4ddab659884fb65619f3
#: c1024950347e405697742e47f046b957 df9825607adb411db378860517b3775a
msgid "Populating a screen's parameter slots using MAVProxy's OSD module"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy OSD 模块填充屏幕参数槽位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:105 011232f474d64d3ea4cafe12f07f9b97
#: 0451c89572ee4f809d374d1b0e45986d 2697fd904d0f4ae19b2295c6d9ff6d33
#: ace5881d130849f8b3a89ba33e6b6517 df12ca0261dd479f9abe694dbc33a1b4
msgid ""
"OSD based parameter setting includes a `MAVProxy module "
"<https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/>`__ to populate each screen's parameter "
"slots. Connect your autopilot, connect tp MAVProxy and load the OSD module "
"by typing :code:`module load osd`"
msgstr ""
"基于 OSD 的参数设置包含一个 `MAVProxy 模块 <https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/>`__ "
"用于填充每个屏幕的参数槽位。连接飞控，连接到 MAVProxy 并通过输入 :code:`module load osd` 加载 OSD 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:110 0c97a4057bf3458fab845d34bbc1a995
#: 6a5c361ec8724492ad1f3fd160762620 8acbc7941cad413f874718fceb41505a
#: bd2a302cc10c4f259e84f3705b989e25 f8b8e7a7e9634afca8c85e9e87e3cfa0
msgid ""
"The osd module is supported by MAVProxy 1.8.21 and later. Type :code:`pip "
"install --upgrade pymavlink MAVProxy --user` to update MAVProxy if required."
msgstr ""
"osd 模块由 MAVProxy 1.8.21 及更高版本支持。如需更新 MAVProxy，请输入 :code:`pip install "
"--upgrade pymavlink MAVProxy --user`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:114 69c83ee1a9a84b608547fc96975888cc
#: 7a2a1c01d7a442458cd16eb121a4c3f2 8426095e1de7471cbc17a82023ffb151
#: 939ba02a49474ee094f7f137ad2591d7 9526598decac48e881b0f94ccba746bf
msgid ""
"Use the following syntax to set and show a parameter, its type, minimum, "
"maximum and increments:"
msgstr "使用以下语法设置和查看参数、其类型、最小值、最大值和步进量："

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:116 1f70f7b6da6e4da9a1d16a226fb6c8a4
