":code:` osd param-set <screen> <index> <name> (<type> | <min> <max> "
"<increment>)`"
msgstr ""
":code:` osd param-set <screen> <index> <name> (<type> | <min> <max> "
"<increment>)`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:118 078d28da9a954b02b3738449b0dc1d7f
